 "implementation": "Luna M7 Firmware Cryptographic Library",
 "product_id": "17653",
 "description": "The Luna M7 Firmware Cryptographic Library implements a firmware only solution to provide a broad suite of high-performance cryptographic operations and functionality to the Luna M7 Cryptographic Module. The Luna M7 Cryptographic Module from Thales Trusted Cyber Technologies (TCT) is a high-assurance, tamper-resistant Hardware Security Module (HSM) implemented in a multi-chip embedded hardware module that is typically used in a handheld tablet device such as the T-Series of the Luna Backup HSM and the Luna USB HSM. It provides end users with industry-leading security and performance and can quickly be added to workstations, servers and security appliances for FIPS 140-3 validated key security. The cryptographic module is contained in an enclosure that provides physical resistance to tampering. Thales TCT's Luna HSMs are developed, manufactured, sold, and supported in the United States.",
